1
00:00:20,575 --> 00:00:22,850
In 2019, Professor Jing

2
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:24,850
claimed to have discovered time travel.

3
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:27,587
The claim shook the world of physics.

4
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,780
He later suffered a mental breakdown.

5
00:00:31,025 --> 00:00:33,025
His research equipment vanished.

6
00:00:33,057 --> 00:00:35,057
Time travel was dismissed

7
00:00:35,325 --> 00:00:38,033
as a crackpot's delusion.

8
00:00:38,033 --> 00:00:39,761
Then bizarre incidents began to mount.

9
00:00:39,761 --> 00:00:41,175
People began to suspect the machine

10
00:00:41,175 --> 00:00:43,175
had fallen into the wrong hands.

11
00:00:52,775 --> 00:00:53,675
Hello?

12
00:00:54,075 --> 00:00:55,025
Hi, Xiaodie.

13
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:57,350
Pick me up after work?

14
00:00:57,350 --> 00:00:58,500
I've got the afternoon off.

15
00:00:58,500 --> 00:00:59,225
Sure.

16
00:00:59,225 --> 00:01:00,275
See you in half an hour.

17
00:01:00,275 --> 00:01:01,250
See you soon.

18
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:03,150
See you.

19
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:50,550
You're here!

20
00:01:50,550 --> 00:01:51,350
Yeah.

21
00:01:52,025 --> 00:01:53,250
Wait in the next room.

22
00:01:53,250 --> 00:01:53,950
I'll join you.

23
00:01:53,950 --> 00:01:54,527
Okay.

24
00:01:54,527 --> 00:01:55,277
Okay.

25
00:02:16,025 --> 00:02:17,025
Let me introduce you.

26
00:02:17,025 --> 00:02:18,775
This is my fiancé,

27
00:02:18,775 --> 00:02:19,800
Li Weishi.

28
00:02:20,700 --> 00:02:21,340
And this is

29
00:02:21,340 --> 00:02:22,507
a good friend of mine

30
00:02:22,616 --> 00:02:24,075
here at the care home.

31
00:02:24,187 --> 00:02:25,525
Her name's Lin Jianhe.

32
00:02:27,375 --> 00:02:28,600
What are you doing here?

33
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:32,427
What happened to your legs?

34
00:02:48,462 --> 00:02:49,550
Lin Jianhe...

35
00:03:45,025 --> 00:03:46,100
Hey!

36
00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:46,964
What are you doing?

37
00:03:47,975 --> 00:03:49,050
Who are you?

38
00:03:49,550 --> 00:03:50,425
Don't yell at me!

39
00:03:50,667 --> 00:03:51,550
Hands off!

40
00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:54,725
What's wrong with you?

41
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:56,917
Have you no decency?

42
00:03:57,550 --> 00:03:58,459
Have you no decency?

43
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:00,350
Don't touch me!

44
00:04:06,650 --> 00:04:08,050
Have you no shame?

45
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:11,200
Why are you calling me?

46
00:04:11,700 --> 00:04:13,700
You're the one who cheated!

47
00:04:14,075 --> 00:04:15,500
You bastard!

48
00:04:15,950 --> 00:04:17,650
I never want to see you again!

49
00:04:17,650 --> 00:04:18,650
Get lost!

50
00:04:24,505 --> 00:04:25,255
It's okay.

51
00:04:26,100 --> 00:04:28,100
It's late. Let me take you home.

52
00:04:28,508 --> 00:04:29,258
I'm fine.

53
00:04:29,792 --> 00:04:31,050
But you're drunk.

54
00:04:31,384 --> 00:04:33,050
I'm not drunk!

55
00:04:33,775 --> 00:04:34,325
Let me.

56
00:04:34,325 --> 00:04:35,189
I'll take you home.

57
00:04:36,481 --> 00:04:37,028
Not drunk.

58
00:04:37,028 --> 00:04:37,892
I'll take you home.

59
00:04:39,865 --> 00:04:40,790
You've had enough.

60
00:04:46,731 --> 00:04:47,953
Thanks for taking me home.

61
00:04:48,405 --> 00:04:49,269
I feel much better.

62
00:04:58,500 --> 00:05:00,500
Shall we exchange numbers?

63
00:05:02,775 --> 00:05:03,575
Sure.

64
00:05:18,950 --> 00:05:19,848
Bye.

65
00:05:20,300 --> 00:05:21,175
Hey!

66
00:05:22,725 --> 00:05:23,650
Keep in touch.

67
00:05:45,750 --> 00:05:46,875
Li Weishi.

68
00:05:47,900 --> 00:05:50,175
So you're the jerk who dumped Jianhe.

69
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:52,525
I dumped her?

70
00:05:53,175 --> 00:05:54,336
She's the one who cheated!

71
00:05:54,336 --> 00:05:55,200
And I dumped her?

72
00:05:56,325 --> 00:05:57,425
Three years ago,

73
00:05:57,850 --> 00:05:59,850
you were the one who ended it.

74
00:06:00,850 --> 00:06:02,218
Then she got drunk on her own

75
00:06:02,218 --> 00:06:03,375
and had a car accident.

76
00:06:03,925 --> 00:06:05,150
It's all because of you.

77
00:06:06,625 --> 00:06:07,950
Is that what she told you?

78
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:10,175
Liar.

79
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,650
If you ever leave me,

80
00:06:16,075 --> 00:06:18,075
will you tell people I cheated too?

81
00:06:29,175 --> 00:06:30,675
Wasn't I the one she cheated on?

82
00:06:30,675 --> 00:06:32,675
What's going on here?

83
00:06:32,675 --> 00:06:34,675
I have to find out.

84
00:06:45,775 --> 00:06:47,775
I've got too little to go on.

85
00:06:50,412 --> 00:06:51,087
Xu,

86
00:06:51,087 --> 00:06:52,280
could you look into this?

87
00:06:52,651 --> 00:06:54,651
On February 14, 2019,

88
00:06:54,651 --> 00:06:56,901
a TV presenter had a car accident.

89
00:06:56,901 --> 00:06:58,326
Her name was Lin Jianhe.

90
00:06:58,326 --> 00:06:59,951
Details attached.

91
00:06:59,951 --> 00:07:01,016
Li Weishi.

92
00:07:23,696 --> 00:07:24,446
Weishi!

93
00:07:24,698 --> 00:07:25,625
Listen to me.

94
00:07:25,773 --> 00:07:27,069
What happened to Lin Jianhe

95
00:07:27,069 --> 00:07:27,819
is connected to

96
00:07:27,908 --> 00:07:29,617
Professor Jing Yubin's research.

97
00:07:30,765 --> 00:07:31,723
I'm heading there...

98
00:07:31,723 --> 00:07:33,122
Professor Jing Yubin?

99
00:07:33,799 --> 00:07:34,549
Hello?

100
00:07:35,184 --> 00:07:35,964
Hello?

101
00:08:37,300 --> 00:08:40,400
Chapter 2: Memories
